{"seq":3,"slug":"rule-conflict-resolution","title":"多规则冲突与优先级：把偏序变成确定的全序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/merchandising-rules/rule-conflict-resolution","wordCount":2388,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"多规则冲突与优先级-把偏序变成确定的全序\">多规则冲突与优先级：把偏序变成确定的全序</h1><p>一个大型站点的干预规则数量通常在几千到几万条之间。当两条规则同时命中同一个文档，且给出方向相反的动作（一条加权、一条降权），系统必须给出唯一答案——而且这个答案必须稳定、可复现、可解释。这件事在数学上并不平凡：规则之间的「谁更具体」是一个偏序，而执行需要一个全序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-冲突的四种形态\">核心概念：冲突的四种形态</h2><p>先把「冲突」拆细，因为四种冲突需要的解析手段完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突形态</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>是否为真冲突</th>\n<th>解析手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同向叠加</td>\n<td>两条规则都加权 1.3</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>乘子连乘或取最大（需约定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向对抗</td>\n<td>一条加权 1.3、一条降权 0.5</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>优先级裁决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层面交叉</td>\n<td>一条置顶、一条屏蔽同一商品</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>层面间固定优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合矛盾</td>\n<td>一条置顶商品 X、一条置顶商品 Y 到同一位置</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>位置分配算法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[命中的规则集合] --&gt; S1{同向?}&#10;    S1 --&gt;|是| C1[合并乘子]&#10;    S1 --&gt;|否| S2{同一层面?}&#10;    S2 --&gt;|是| C2[按 priority 裁决]&#10;    S2 --&gt;|否| C3[层面优先级: 屏蔽 &gt; 置顶 &gt; 加权/降权]&#10;    C1 --&gt; O[唯一决策]&#10;    C2 --&gt; O&#10;    C3 --&gt; O&#10;    C3 --&gt; P{位置冲突?}&#10;    P --&gt;|是| C4[位置分配算法]&#10;    P --&gt;|否| O&#10;    C4 --&gt; O\">graph TD\n    R[命中的规则集合] --&gt; S1{同向?}\n    S1 --&gt;|是| C1[合并乘子]\n    S1 --&gt;|否| S2{同一层面?}\n    S2 --&gt;|是| C2[按 priority 裁决]\n    S2 --&gt;|否| C3[层面优先级: 屏蔽 &gt; 置顶 &gt; 加权/降权]\n    C1 --&gt; O[唯一决策]\n    C2 --&gt; O\n    C3 --&gt; O\n    C3 --&gt; P{位置冲突?}\n    P --&gt;|是| C4[位置分配算法]\n    P --&gt;|否| O\n    C4 --&gt; O</pre><h2 id=\"同向叠加-连乘还是取最大\">同向叠加：连乘还是取最大</h2><p>两条加权规则叠加时，最常见的实现是<strong>连乘</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.69</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = 1.3 \\times 1.3 = 1.69</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.69</span></span></span></span></span>。这在规则少的时候没问题，但它有一个隐蔽的爆炸性质——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条同向规则的效果是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，指数增长。十条例规则各 1.2 倍，最终是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.19</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，足以让一个相关性中等的结果冲到首位。</p>\n<p>另一种是<strong>取最大</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\max(1.3, 1.3) = 1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span>。它保证效果有界（乘子集合的有限档位构成上界），但代价是「叠加更多规则不再有更强效果」，运营会发现「加规则没用」。</p>\n<p>工程上的折中方案是<strong>带上限的连乘</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>boost</mtext></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\min\\Big(\\prod_{r \\in R_{\\text{boost}}} m_r,\\; m_{\\max}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5502em;vertical-align:-1.4002em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">boost</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4002em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 2.0 到 3.0。这个上限不是拍脑袋：它应该由「在黄金查询集上，乘子达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时首位替换率不超过 X%」反推得到，并写进回归测试。降权方向同理，下限通常取 0.2 到 0.3，低于这个值效果等同于屏蔽，那就应该直接用屏蔽——这也是一条实用判据：<strong>当降权乘子低于 0.3 时，检查这条规则是不是被误写成了降权</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级-specificity-偏序与显式-priority\">优先级：specificity 偏序与显式 priority</h2><p><a href=\"rule-scope-conditions\">规则作用域（品类/市场/查询）</a> 提到，按 specificity 比较规则在数学上只能得到偏序：规则 A 在市场维度更具体、规则 B 在类目维度更具体，两者不可比较。业界有两条路：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：维度权重求和。</strong> 给每个维度一个权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，规则的 specificity 分数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>spec</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>depth</mtext><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{spec}(r) = \\sum_{f \\in F} w_f \\cdot \\text{depth}_f(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spec</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">depth</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>depth</mtext><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{depth}_f(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">depth</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是规则在该维度上的具体程度（全球=0，区域=1，站点=2；类目根=0，类目叶子=3）。这个求和把偏序压成了全序，简单、可解释、可预测。代价是它可能给出违反直觉的结果：一条「站点=德国」的规则（spec=2）会输给一条「类目叶子」的规则（spec=3），哪怕运营认为站点更具体。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：显式 priority + 确定性打破平局。</strong> 每条规则带一个整型 <code>priority</code>，冲突时大者胜；<code>priority</code> 相同时用稳定字段（创建时间、规则 ID）打破平局。这条路把「谁赢」的责任交还给规则作者，系统只保证确定性。</p>\n<p>实践中最好的组合是<strong>两者都用</strong>：用维度权重求和算出一个默认 priority（自动覆盖绝大多数规则，运营不必手填），当运营需要覆盖默认行为时显式指定 priority（数值越大越优先），相同时按 <code>(created_at, rule_id)</code> 字典序打破平局。这个三段式决策必须在<strong>任何情况下都输出唯一结果</strong>——不存在「两条规则都赢」或「无法判定」，因为无法判定意味着同一查询在不同机器上可能返回不同结果，这是分布式检索系统里最难排查的一类 bug。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[候选规则集] --&gt; B{有显式 priority?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是 且唯一最大| W[该规则胜出]&#10;    B --&gt;|否 或 并列| C[计算 spec 分数]&#10;    C --&gt; D{spec 唯一最大?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| W&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[按 created_at, rule_id 字典序]&#10;    E --&gt; W&#10;    W --&gt; F[产出唯一决策 + 决策来源链]\">flowchart TD\n    A[候选规则集] --&gt; B{有显式 priority?}\n    B --&gt;|是 且唯一最大| W[该规则胜出]\n    B --&gt;|否 或 并列| C[计算 spec 分数]\n    C --&gt; D{spec 唯一最大?}\n    D --&gt;|是| W\n    D --&gt;|否| E[按 created_at, rule_id 字典序]\n    E --&gt; W\n    W --&gt; F[产出唯一决策 + 决策来源链]</pre><h2 id=\"层面交叉-屏蔽-置顶-加权的固定优先序\">层面交叉：屏蔽、置顶、加权的固定优先序</h2><p>当冲突跨越动作层面时，解析规则应该是<strong>固定的、不参与 priority 竞争的</strong>。推荐顺序是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>屏蔽</strong> 最高优先。屏蔽通常来自合规、法务、风控，不是商业诉求，它必须无条件赢。让运营的加权规则有机会压过屏蔽，等于让商业指标凌驾于合规之上。</li>\n<li><strong>置顶</strong> 次之。置顶是运营明确表达「这个商品必须出现在这个位置」，它应该压过任何分数改写。</li>\n<li><strong>加权/降权</strong> 最低。它们是软性调节，允许被上面两者覆盖。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>固定层面优先序的好处是它可以被硬编码为常量，不依赖数据，因此正确性容易论证。它同时也给运营一个简单的心理模型：「置顶 &gt; 加权」，不需要理解 priority 数值。</p>\n<p>但固定优先序会带来一个必须显式处理的组合：<strong>屏蔽与置顶同时命中</strong>。按上面顺序屏蔽赢，置顶失效——这是对的，但必须产生一条<strong>告警</strong>，因为「运营置顶了商品 + 另一人屏蔽了它」几乎总是流程问题（比如商品被下架但置顶规则忘了清理）。静默地让屏蔽赢而不告警，会让运营困惑「我的置顶为什么没生效」；自动让置顶赢则更糟。告警是正确答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置分配-同一坑位多商品\">位置分配：同一坑位多商品</h2><p>置顶冲突是唯一需要<strong>组合算法</strong>的冲突。如果三条规则分别要求把商品 A、B、C 置顶到「第 1 位」，只有一个能拿到第 1 位。</p>\n<p>处理方式按复杂度递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先到先得</td>\n<td>按 priority 排序，依次占位，后到者顺延到下一个空位</td>\n<td>通用默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺延</td>\n<td>后到者插入到目标位置之后的下一个空位</td>\n<td>多商品同坑位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分散</td>\n<td>按规则指定步长，占据 1、4、7 位</td>\n<td>大促多个主推商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td>冲突时报错，强制运营解决</td>\n<td>强一致性要求场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>默认选<strong>先到先得 + 顺延</strong>，它的行为最接近运营直觉（「我置顶第 1 位，第 1 位被占了就第 2 位」），且实现是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的排序加线性扫描，不引入额外复杂度。分散策略用于大促——主推 5 个商品占据 1/4/7/10/13 位，需要一个显式的 <code>stride</code> 参数。拒绝策略几乎不用，因为它把可用性问题转嫁给了运营，且在大促高并发编辑时会造成死锁式体验。</p>\n<p>位置分配必须<strong>幂等</strong>：同一组置顶规则重复执行必须得到相同结果。这条看似显然，但如果算法里用了哈希集合的无序遍历（比如 JS 的 <code>Set</code>/对象键序在某些实现下依赖插入序），重复执行可能给出不同位次。做法是先按 <code>(priority, rule_id)</code> 排序再分配，让输入顺序确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突解析的产物-版本指纹与决策链\">冲突解析的产物：版本指纹与决策链</h2><p>冲突解析的运行结果应该被物化成两个产物。</p>\n<p><strong>干预版本指纹</strong>：把生效的规则集合、各自的 priority、解析器版本号做一次内容哈希，得到 <code>intervention_version</code>。这个指纹有两个用处：作为检索结果缓存的 key 组成部分（见 <a href=\"pin-boost-bury-block\">置顶、加权、降权与屏蔽规则引擎</a>），以及作为效果归因的切分点——两条不同指纹的策略版本之间可以直接做 AB 对比。</p>\n<p><strong>决策来源链</strong>：对每个被干预的文档，记录「哪些规则赢了、哪些规则输了、为什么」。这条链的结构大致是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;docId&quot;: &quot;SKU-88213&quot;,&#10;  &quot;finalMultiplier&quot;: 1.3,&#10;  &quot;decisions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;r-1001&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;boost&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 1.3, &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;applied&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;r-2044&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;boost&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 1.5, &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;superseded&quot;, &quot;by&quot;: &quot;r-1001&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;r-3071&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;block&quot;, &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;doc_sellable_false&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"docId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-88213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"finalMultiplier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decisions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r-1001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"boost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r-2044\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"boost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"superseded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r-1001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r-3071\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"doc_sellable_false\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>决策链的写入有成本，因此<strong>只对被干预的文档记录</strong>（通常是结果集的头部若干位），而不是全量。它的价值在归因时兑现：当某个商品的 GMV 突然变化，能立刻回答「是干预变了还是自然排序变了」。归因方法本身见 <a href=\"../global-effectiveness/merchandising-attribution\">导购干预效果归因度量</a>。</p>\n<p>冲突解析器本身需要<strong>版本化</strong>。解析规则的改动（比如调整维度权重、改变层面优先序）会瞬间改变大量查询的结果，因此解析器版本号必须进入干预指纹，且解析器升级要走和模型升级同样的灰度流程，而不是一次全量发布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冲突分四种形态：同向叠加、反向对抗、层面交叉、集合矛盾；各自需要不同的解析手段。</li>\n<li>同向叠加用<strong>带上限的连乘</strong>，上限由黄金查询集的回归测试反推；降权乘子低于 0.3 说明该用屏蔽。</li>\n<li>specificity 是偏序，无法直接全序化；用「维度权重求和给默认 priority + 显式 priority 覆盖 + 稳定字段打破平局」三段式。</li>\n<li>跨层面冲突用固定的「屏蔽 &gt; 置顶 &gt; 加权降权」优先序，硬编码为常量；屏蔽与置顶同时命中要告警。</li>\n<li>位置冲突用「先到先得 + 顺延」默认策略，必须幂等（先排序再分配）。</li>\n<li>解析产物是干预版本指纹（缓存 key + AB 切分点）与决策来源链（归因前提）；解析器本身必须版本化并灰度发布。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多规则冲突与优先级：把偏序变成确定的全序","id":"多规则冲突与优先级-把偏序变成确定的全序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：冲突的四种形态","id":"核心概念-冲突的四种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"同向叠加：连乘还是取最大","id":"同向叠加-连乘还是取最大"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级：specificity 偏序与显式 priority","id":"优先级-specificity-偏序与显式-priority"},{"level":2,"text":"层面交叉：屏蔽、置顶、加权的固定优先序","id":"层面交叉-屏蔽-置顶-加权的固定优先序"},{"level":2,"text":"位置分配：同一坑位多商品","id":"位置分配-同一坑位多商品"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突解析的产物：版本指纹与决策链","id":"冲突解析的产物-版本指纹与决策链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规则作用域：品类、市场与查询三级定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/merchandising-rules/rule-scope-conditions"},"next":{"title":"用户画像、行为信号与实时兴趣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/personalization/personalization-signals"}}